1
00:00:05,620 --> 00:00:07,600
(Raj:)Boy, I'm so hungry today.

2
00:00:08,590 --> 00:00:10,160
(Raj:)I wonder why?

3
00:00:11,993 --> 00:00:13,773
(Howard:)Because you had sex the other night?

4
00:00:14,829 --> 00:00:16,429
(Raj:)You know what?

5
00:00:16,598 --> 00:00:18,338
(Raj:)That may be it.

6
00:00:20,001 --> 00:00:22,001
(Raj:)By the way,
it isn't like riding a bike.

7
00:00:22,170 --> 00:00:24,010
(Raj:)Like, I fell off a few times.

8
00:00:26,975 --> 00:00:29,185
(Leonard:)-Hey, buddy.
-Hello.

9
00:00:29,344 --> 00:00:30,514
(Leonard:)You okay?

10
00:00:32,413 --> 00:00:34,623
(Sheldon:)I just got called
into President Siebert's office.

11
00:00:35,683 --> 00:00:37,683
(Sheldon:)The university
won't let me switch my field

12
00:00:37,852 --> 00:00:40,422
(Sheldon:)of study to inflationary
cosmology.

13
00:00:40,588 --> 00:00:43,198
(Sheldon:)They're forcing me
to continue with string theory.

14
00:00:43,358 --> 00:00:46,338
(Raj:)-Why?
-He said it's why they hired me,

15
00:00:46,594 --> 00:00:48,544
(Sheldon:)it's what my grant
was designated for,

16
00:00:48,696 --> 00:00:52,106
(Sheldon:)and that everybody has to
do things they don't want to do.

17
00:00:52,266 --> 00:00:54,176
(Sheldon:)He then gave an example
of something he had to do,

18
00:00:54,335 --> 00:00:57,285
(Sheldon:)even though he didn't want to,
which was look at my stupid face.

19
00:00:59,607 --> 00:01:05,027
(Leonard:)That's a rude thing to say out loud.

